mini_verl is an independent, simplified re-implementation of ideas from the verl project
(https://github.com/volcengine/verl, Copyright 2024 Bytedance Ltd. and/or its affiliates and the
verl contributors, Apache License 2.0). Class, function, metric and config-key names follow verl
(verl v0.9.1) so that the two code bases can be read side by side.
